{"id":"501213b437b1373f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-kodaira-classification.md","title":"Enriques–Kodaira Classification by Kodaira Dimension","display":"thm-kodaira-classification — Enriques–Kodaira Classification by Kodaira Dimension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kodaira-classification","aliases":["58-thm-kodaira-classification"],"display":"thm-kodaira-classification — Enriques–Kodaira Classification by Kodaira Dimension","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kodaira-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kodaira-classification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kodaira-classification — Enriques–Kodaira Classification by Kodaira Dimension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03dcbc472c7a5883\" href=\"?note=03dcbc472c7a5883\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md\">../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,K_X,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(X,K_X,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (surface, canonical divisor, and Kodaira-dimension value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)\\)</span> (Kodaira-dimension relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03dcbc472c7a5883\" href=\"?note=03dcbc472c7a5883\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md\">../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinimalSmoothProjectiveSurface}_{\\mathbb C}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MinimalSmoothProjectiveSurface}_{\\mathbb C}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (minimal smooth projective complex-surface predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RationalSurface},\\mathrm{RuledSurface},\\mathrm{K3Surface},\\mathrm{EnriquesSurface}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RationalSurface},\\mathrm{RuledSurface},\\mathrm{K3Surface},\\mathrm{EnriquesSurface}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (surface-class predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianSurface},\\mathrm{BiellipticSurface},\\mathrm{ProperlyEllipticSurface},\\mathrm{GeneralTypeSurface}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianSurface},\\mathrm{BiellipticSurface},\\mathrm{ProperlyEllipticSurface},\\mathrm{GeneralTypeSurface}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (surface-class predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kodaira}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinimalSmoothProjectiveSurface}_{\\mathbb C}(X)\\land\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\kappa\\in\\{-\\infty,0,1,2\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=-\\infty\\to\n(\\mathrm{RationalSurface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{RuledSurface}(X))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=0\\to\n(\\mathrm{K3Surface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{EnriquesSurface}(X)\n\\lor\\mathrm{AbelianSurface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{BiellipticSurface}(X))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=1\\to\\mathrm{ProperlyEllipticSurface}(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=2\\to\\mathrm{GeneralTypeSurface}(X)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kodaira}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinimalSmoothProjectiveSurface}_{\\mathbb C}(X)\\land\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\kappa\\in\\{-\\infty,0,1,2\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=-\\infty\\to\n(\\mathrm{RationalSurface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{RuledSurface}(X))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=0\\to\n(\\mathrm{K3Surface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{EnriquesSurface}(X)\n\\lor\\mathrm{AbelianSurface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{BiellipticSurface}(X))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=1\\to\\mathrm{ProperlyEllipticSurface}(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=2\\to\\mathrm{GeneralTypeSurface}(X)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimality is essential: blowing up a surface does not change its Kodaira dimension but destroys minimality.</li>\n<li>The displayed four cases are the projective-surface form of the Enriques–Kodaira classification.</li>\n<li>The theorem uses the repository's ternary Kodaira-dimension relation; it does not treat <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(X)\">\\(\\kappa(X)\\)</span> as an untyped primitive function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md","status":"resolved","id":"03dcbc472c7a5883","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md","status":"resolved","id":"03dcbc472c7a5883","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)$ (Kodaira-dimension relation, see [[../batch06/58-df-kodaira-dimension.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,K_X,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinimalSmoothProjectiveSurface}_{\\mathbb C}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RationalSurface},\\mathrm{RuledSurface},\\mathrm{K3Surface},\\mathrm{EnriquesSurface}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianSurface},\\mathrm{BiellipticSurface},\\mathrm{ProperlyEllipticSurface},\\mathrm{GeneralTypeSurface}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kodaira}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinimalSmoothProjectiveSurface}_{\\mathbb C}(X)\\land\\mathrm{KodairaDimension}_S(\\kappa,X,K_X)\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\kappa\\in\\{-\\infty,0,1,2\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=-\\infty\\to\n(\\mathrm{RationalSurface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{RuledSurface}(X))\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=0\\to\n(\\mathrm{K3Surface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{EnriquesSurface}(X)\n\\lor\\mathrm{AbelianSurface}(X)\\lor\\mathrm{BiellipticSurface}(X))\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=1\\to\\mathrm{ProperlyEllipticSurface}(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=2\\to\\mathrm{GeneralTypeSurface}(X)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa(X)","display":false}],"bytes":2096,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-kodaira-classification.md|58-thm-kodaira-classification]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["03dcbc472c7a5883","0ab38aca0c5161bb"]}